[4:36PM] #Apongbon #EkoBridge #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is on the high side from Broad Street inwards Apongbon underneath the bridge, then as you move towards the Eko Bridge proper, it is better moving to Costain where high influx might slow you down approaching Costain Ramp.

